# The IronRDP source Relay's remote desktop client is built from (see desktop/scripts/build-ironrdp.sh).
# ref:     the full commit of github.com/Devolutions/IronRDP. The build refuses anything else.
# release: the newest IronRDP release tag when this was pinned (the update workflow looks for a newer one).
# rust:    the toolchain that commit pins in its own rust-toolchain.toml.
# wasm_pack: the wasm-pack version that commit's xtask uses.
#
# Why a commit and not the release: release npm-iron-remote-desktop-rdp-v0.7.0 (May 2026) predates
# IronRDP PR #1486 (preserve bitmap source stride), without which servers such as xrdp are drawn sheared
# and unusable. Tested against xrdp 0.9.24. Move to the next release that contains it.
ref=da016ce860040c6cb37943cfc857d836735d252c
release=npm-iron-remote-desktop-rdp-v0.7.0
rust=1.94.1
wasm_pack=0.15.0
